        "id": "a5e99018-0e54-4884-840e-e36a6c765395",
        "name": "Note: error notify",
        "parameters": {
          "color": 4,
          "content": "## error : notify error over telegram\n\n1. Look up `tg_notifs_chat_id`.\n2. Probe Telegram the same way as master : setup (get chat, continue on error).\n3. If the probe works, send the error alert.\n4. If Telegram is not set up, or the send fails: append the original error JSON to `/files/batchupdate/logs/ERROR_TELEGRAM_NOTIFICATION_FAIL_{yyyy_MM}.json`, then append a second JSON note (not set up, or send-failed with details).\n\nDo not point this workflow’s own Error Workflow at itself.",
